---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import family from '../assets/enrolment-family-journey-20260929.png';
import EnrolmentJourney from './EnrolmentJourney.astro';
import EnrolmentCentreCard from './EnrolmentCentreCard.astro';
import centres from '../data/centre-directory.json';
import {phone,url,origin} from '../data/site';
import '../styles/enrolment.css';
import '../styles/enrolment-story.css';
const {previewOnly=true,apiEndpoint=''}=Astro.props;
const livePath='/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india';
const path=previewOnly?'/pinnacle-pages-preview/enrolment':livePath;
if(!previewOnly){
 const endpoint=new URL(apiEndpoint,origin);
 if(!apiEndpoint||endpoint.origin!==origin||!endpoint.pathname.startsWith('/api/')||endpoint.search||endpoint.hash||endpoint.username||endpoint.password)throw new Error('Live enrolment requires the approved same-origin Cloudflare API path.');
}
const services=[['help','Help me choose','compass'],['speech','Speech & language','voice'],['occupational','Occupational therapy','home'],['aba','ABA / behavioural support','heart'],['education','Special education','book'],['other','Another service','people']];
const regions=[...new Set(centres.map(c=>c.region))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b));
const proof=[
 ['compass','A purpose you can recognise','Your child’s everyday life gives abilities, goals, practice and review their direction.','Read the life-first approach','/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html'],
 ['shield','Licensed developmental-support software','PinnacleAI® GPT-OS v1.0.0 is licensed as Class B, non-diagnostic developmental-support software for children aged 0–12.','Read the MD-5 record','/verify/evidence/records/md5.html'],
 ['book','Research you can read','Explore published methods and study summaries, with each source’s status and scope explained.','Explore the research library','/verify/evidence/research-library.html'],
 ['people','An organisation you can identify','Pinnacle Blooms Network is operated by Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited.','Verify the organisation','/verify/evidence/records/lei.html']
];
const citations=proof.map(p=>url(p[4])).concat([url('/verify/#family-observations'),url('/verify/#feedback-changes-plan')]);
const questions=[
 ['What can I discuss in the first conversation?','Tell us about everyday moments you want to make easier: communicating a need, managing a routine, learning or taking part with others. Ask about assessment, suitable support, the centre and fees. You do not need to know the name of a therapy to begin.'],
 ['How will my family be involved?','Your priorities and observations help shape the work. Parent-guided everyday practice connects developing abilities with daily routines, and review helps the team decide what to adjust next.'],
 ['What should I bring to a visit?','Bring your questions and any existing reports you would like the professional to consider. The team will confirm what is relevant for your appointment. There is no need to upload medical information to this enquiry form.'],
 ['Do I need to choose a therapy before contacting you?','No. Select “Help me choose” or call us. An appropriate professional assessment helps determine what support is suitable.'],
 ['What happens after I request a visit?','The team contacts you to discuss your priorities and confirm the centre, professional, appointment and any fees. A request is the first step; your appointment is confirmed with you.'],
 ['Is the assessment free?','The current speech and language assessment campaign offers a FREE assessment. Other assessments and ongoing therapy may have different fees. Confirm the service and its charges with the team before your visit.']
];
---
<PageLayout path={path} label="Arrange a visit" title="Your Child’s Next Step | Visit Pinnacle Blooms Network" description="Explore Pinnacle’s life-first approach, find your centre and request a visit. Assessment, therapy, family practice and review toward growing independence. Call 9100 181 181." shareImage={family} imageAlt="Illustration connecting a family conversation, everyday practice and a child participating with peers." imageCaption="Your child’s life is the goal. Your family belongs in the journey." citations={citations} publishedOn="2026-09-28" updatedOn="2026-09-29" documentOnly previewOnly={previewOnly} enquiry={{url:'#enrolment-form',mobileLabel:'Request a visit'}}>
 <section class="enrol-hero wrap" aria-labelledby="enrol-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Pinnacle Blooms Network · Your family’s next step</p><h1 id="enrol-title">Your child’s life<br/>is the goal.<br/><em>Let’s build the next step around it.</em></h1><p class="enrol-lead">A self-sufficient, mainstream-included life gives our work its direction. Assessment, therapies, family practice and regular review work toward that purpose—with you involved in the decisions.</p><div class="enrol-hero-actions"><a href="#enrolment-form" class="button primary">Request a visit <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a href={phone.href} class="button outline" data-cta="hero-call"><Icon name="phone"/> Call {phone.display}</a></div><p class="enrol-hero-help">Not sure which therapy to choose? Start with a conversation.</p></div>
  <figure class="enrol-hero-art"><Image src={family} widths={[480,720,1080]} sizes="(min-width:900px) 48vw, 100vw" width={1080} format="webp" quality={82} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustrative family journey: listening together, practising everyday skills and taking part with other children."/><figcaption>Your priorities. Your participation. Your child’s possibilities.</figcaption></figure>
 </section>
 <section class="wrap enrol-reasons" aria-labelledby="why-pinnacle-title"><div class="enrol-reasons-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Why choose Pinnacle?</p><h2 id="why-pinnacle-title">A direction you understand.<br/><em>A journey you help shape.</em></h2></div><div class="enrol-reason-grid">
  <article><span class="enrol-icon"><Icon name="compass" size={30}/></span><h3>Start with what matters in life.</h3><p>Communication, daily routines, learning and participation give the work its direction.</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>How the approach works →</a></article>
  <article><span class="enrol-icon"><Icon name="people" size={30}/></span><h3>Keep your family involved.</h3><p>Understand the priorities, practise with guidance and bring your observations into review.</p><a href={url('/verify/#family-observations')}>Your family’s role →</a></article>
  <article><span class="enrol-icon"><Icon name="loop" size={30}/></span><h3>Keep reviewing the next step.</h3><p>Look at what is changing in everyday life and use that information to adjust the plan.</p><a href={url('/verify/#feedback-changes-plan')}>How feedback shapes the plan →</a></article>
 </div></section>
 <section class="enrol-body wrap" id="enrolment-form" aria-labelledby="request-title">
  <div class="enrol-card"><p class="eyebrow">Let’s make the first step simple</p><h2 id="request-title">Let’s talk about your child.</h2><p class="enrol-form-intro">Your name and number are enough to begin. Everything else is optional.</p>
   {previewOnly&&<p class="enrol-preview-note">Design preview · This form does not send enquiries. To contact us now, <a href={url(livePath)}>use the live enrolment form</a> or call {phone.display}.</p>}
   <form id="pinnacle-enrolment" method="post" action={previewOnly?'#':apiEndpoint} novalidate data-preview={String(previewOnly)} data-api-endpoint={previewOnly?'':apiEndpoint} data-source-path={livePath} aria-describedby="enrol-privacy">
    <noscript><p class="enrol-error-summary">Please enable JavaScript to use this form, or <a href={phone.href}>call {phone.display}</a>.</p></noscript>
    <p id="enrol-unavailable" class="field-help">Loading the form… If it stays unavailable, please <a href={phone.href}>call {phone.display}</a>.</p>
    <div id="enrol-error-summary" class="enrol-error-summary" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
    <fieldset disabled data-enrol-fields><legend><span>1</span>Your contact details</legend><div class="enrol-fields">
     <div><label for="parent-name">Your name <span>(required)</span></label><input id="parent-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" aria-describedby="parent-name-error"/><p class="field-error" id="parent-name-error"></p></div>
     <div><label for="parent-phone">Mobile number <span>(required)</span></label><input id="parent-phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="25" placeholder="Your contact number" aria-describedby="phone-help parent-phone-error"/><p class="field-help" id="phone-help">Outside India? Include your country code.</p><p class="field-error" id="parent-phone-error"></p></div>
    </div></fieldset>
    <fieldset disabled data-enrol-fields><legend><span>2</span>Your preferences <small>(optional)</small></legend>
     <p class="enrol-choice-label" id="service-label">What would you like help with?</p><div class="enrol-service-options" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="service-label">{services.map(([value,label,icon])=><label class="enrol-service-choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value={value} checked={value==='help'}/><Icon name={icon}/><span>{label}</span></label>)}</div>
     <div class="enrol-fields"><div class="full"><label for="preferred-centre">Preferred centre</label><select id="preferred-centre" name="centre"><option value="">Help me find a centre</option>{regions.map(region=><optgroup label={region}>{centres.filter(c=>c.region===region).sort((a,b)=>a.city.localeCompare(b.city)||a.name.localeCompare(b.name)).map(c=><option value={c.id}>{c.city} — {c.name}</option>)}</optgroup>)}</select><p class="field-help">We’ll confirm the service and availability before you travel.</p></div></div>
     <EnrolmentCentreCard/>
     <details class="enrol-optional"><summary>Add an email or a short note <span>(optional)</span></summary><div class="enrol-fields">
      <div class="full"><label for="parent-email">Email</label><input id="parent-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" aria-describedby="parent-email-error"/><p class="field-error" id="parent-email-error"></p></div>
      <div class="full"><label for="family-priority">Anything you’d like us to know?</label><textarea id="family-priority" name="message" rows="3" maxlength="500" aria-describedby="message-help" placeholder="For example: I would like to understand the assessment process."></textarea><p class="field-help" id="message-help">A short enquiry is enough. Please save medical reports and detailed child information for your private conversation with the team.</p></div>
     </div></details>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="enrol-submit"><p id="enrol-privacy">We use your details to respond to this enquiry. <a href={url('/privacy-policy')}>Privacy policy</a>.</p><button class="button primary" type="submit" id="enrol-submit" disabled>{previewOnly?'Check form preview':'Request a visit'} <Icon name="arrow"/></button><div id="enrol-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></div><p class="field-help">Your appointment, service and fees are confirmed by the team.</p><p class="enrol-call-alternative">Prefer to talk? <a href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call">Call {phone.display}</a>.</p></div>
   </form>
  </div>
  <aside class="enrol-aside">
   <div class="enrol-decision"><span class="enrol-icon"><Icon name="heart" size={32}/></span><p class="eyebrow">You choose with clarity</p><h2>A conversation today.<br/><em>A clearer decision for your family.</em></h2><p>Tell us what matters most. Ask the questions on your mind. Understand the options before you decide on ongoing support.</p></div>
   <section class="enrol-next"><p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p><h2>Here’s where we begin.</h2><ol><li><Icon name="phone"/><div><h3>We listen to you</h3><p>Share your priorities and ask your questions. We help you choose where to begin.</p></div></li><li><Icon name="pin"/><div><h3>We arrange the visit with you</h3><p>Confirm the centre, professional, appointment, any fees and what to bring.</p></div></li><li><Icon name="compass"/><div><h3>You decide with clarity</h3><p>Understand the assessment and recommendations before choosing ongoing support.</p></div></li></ol></section>
   <section class="enrol-trust"><Icon name="shield" size={30}/><h3>Confidence you can inspect.</h3><p>See the licensed software scope, the research behind the approach and the organisation accountable for it.</p><a href="#enrol-evidence">See the evidence below ↓</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacleai-regulatory-journey.html')}>The complete PinnacleAI story →</a></section>
  </aside>
 </section>
 <EnrolmentJourney/>
 <section class="enrol-everyday section" aria-labelledby="everyday-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="enrol-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">An everyday example</p><h2 id="everyday-title">A small moment.<br/><em>A meaningful ability.</em></h2><p>“I want my child to be able to ask for water.” A daily-life priority helps make the work concrete.</p></div><div class="enrol-example-grid"><article><Icon name="voice" size={32}/><h3>Agree a useful goal</h3><p>The professional and family explore how the child currently communicates a need and what to work toward.</p></article><article><Icon name="home" size={32}/><h3>Practise where it matters</h3><p>Guided practice brings the goal into suitable moments at home and in other everyday routines.</p></article><article><Icon name="track" size={32}/><h3>Notice. Review. Adjust.</h3><p>What happened? What support helped? Family observations contribute to the next review.</p></article></div><p class="enrol-example-note">An illustration of the approach. Goals, communication methods and support are individual to each child.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/verify/#goals-to-everyday-practice')}>See how goals connect to everyday practice →</a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap enrol-proof" id="enrol-evidence" aria-labelledby="enrol-proof-title"><div class="enrol-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Open. Honest. Transparent. Self-critical.</p><h2 id="enrol-proof-title">Big decisions deserve<br/><em>more than promises.</em></h2><p>Read the sources behind the approach, the software and the organisation. Each record explains what it establishes.</p></div><div class="enrol-proof-grid">{proof.map(([icon,title,body,label,href])=><article><Icon name={icon} size={30}/><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p><a href={url(href)}>{label} →</a></article>)}</div><p class="enrol-proof-note">The software licence describes its permitted scope; your child’s plan and progress are individual. Research records distinguish methods, preliminary findings and company study summaries.</p></section>
 <section class="section wrap enrol-questions" aria-labelledby="enrol-questions-title"><h2 id="enrol-questions-title">Before your first visit</h2>{questions.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</section>
 <section class="wrap enrol-close" aria-labelledby="enrol-close-title"><Icon name="sun" size={42}/><div><p class="eyebrow">Begin with what matters to your family</p><h2 id="enrol-close-title">Let’s find the next step.<br/>Together.</h2><p>You don’t have to choose a therapy before speaking with us.</p></div><div class="enrol-close-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#enrolment-form">Request a visit <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="button outline" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call">Call {phone.display}</a></div></section>
 <script is:inline type="module" src="/pinnacle-pages-scripts/enrolment.js"></script>
</PageLayout>
